[{"title":"以坡公君如大江日千里我如此水千山底为韵作小诗十四首重送在伯盖深有感于斯句云 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"落此鼪鼯野，宜从麋鹿群。\n何知交友内，而乃得夫君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47158,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以坡公君如大江日千里我如此水千山底为韵作小诗十四首重送在伯盖深有感于斯句云 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"楚国千年薮，岷山万里江。\n胡为入吟笔，政以落蓬窗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47159,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以坡公君如大江日千里我如此水千山底为韵作小诗十四首重送在伯盖深有感于斯句云 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"今日东阳郡，城南尺五天。\n胡为五溪行，道里踰几千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47160,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以坡公君如大江日千里我如此水千山底为韵作小诗十四首重送在伯盖深有感于斯句云 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"何氏之从学，源流远有馀。\n穷经类元凯，能赋似相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47161,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以茶寄杨溥之二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"忆过君家置酒杯，病予方止只空陪。\n而今梦想论文地，柳合沙堤鸥去来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47162,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以茶寄杨溥之二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"要题尺素问何如，病过春风体益癯。\n采得山茶漫持寄，草玄馀暇想时须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47163,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以笋送诸公二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"昔闻市上三时卖，今已春深见未尝。\n莫道寒历只寒相，及时也复事分张。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47164,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以笋送诸公二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"兰在当门未免锄，竹生那可碍阶除。\n莫言无罪充庖宰，自汝为生托地疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47165,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以酒钱送明叔二绝代简 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"酒钱时乞故怜苏，三百青铜寄与沽。\n砚水长枯肺仍渴，可兹涓滴所能濡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47166,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以酒钱送明叔二绝代简 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"我乃病多长止酒，有时渴梦落江湖。\n江天阔处识君阁，要破熟茶共嗫嚅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47167,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以湖州酥秀州木犀面油太和石本观音像送莫万安三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"涪翁昔作白下宰，遗墨到今多雁书。\n尽说补陀存相好，更传雷火护持馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47168,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以湖州酥秀州木犀面油太和石本观音像送莫万安三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"天教桂蕊擅秋分，只道非秋无复存。\n底事兰开梅落际，忽于膏饰见追魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47169,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以湖州酥秀州木犀面油太和石本观音像送莫万安三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"蚁浮犹腊要酥同，长恨中州信不通。\n忽得吴中所持寄，急令分减报乡风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47170,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以短轴从杨谨仲求字仅书其半而见还绝句戏谢","author":"赵蕃","text":"先生字有千金直，乞取宁非亦坐贪。\n更欲从公请终卷，又虞卖菜或蒙惭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47171,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以蜡梅分供堂头希卢首座冲南首座惠绝句次韵并简堂头二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"才尽年来怕及春，上人那说是诗人。\n拨残芋火宁馀事，故欲撩公懒是真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47172,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以蜡梅分供堂头希卢首座冲南首座惠绝句次韵并简堂头二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"蜜黄初出一枝春，分似堂中得定人。\n各各闻香获三昧，信知文字本非真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47173,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日寄成父四首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"客里那知岁月迁，梅花报我又今年。\n兰溪桥下扁舟泊，把笔题诗意惘然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47174,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日寄成父四首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"冒晨造谒愧悠悠，残客不来门更幽。\n邂逅行人觅花看，春风已属杏梢头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47175,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日寄成父四首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"家家节物竞今朝，风俗未分南北遥。\n莫向除薪觅如愿，且凭爆竹走山魈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47176,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日寄成父四首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"旧时元日羡吾庐，称寿献觞欢有馀。\n今日儿曹还效我，凄然事忆十年初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47177,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十二日病中得雨顿觉沈疴去体欣然起饮遂成一绝","author":"赵蕃","text":"涉秋得雨便生凉，起我萧然病在床。\n径自典衣谋一醉，要令清梦略还乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47178,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午过无锡明日五更到平江门外","author":"赵蕃","text":"百里风帆日未中，惠山紫翠忽重重。\n姑苏城外枫林寺，夜半已过闻晓钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47179,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"反禽言二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"禦雨无过以瓦为，古人朴直致君辞。\n我今闭户疏还往，滑滑从深三尺泥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47180,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"反禽言二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"雨后翛然欲变秋，意捐絺绤揽衣裘。\n林间脱裤催人急，时有炎凉底过忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47181,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"尹丈少稷旧作借竹轩诗数首如雨重时惊入屋梢风微亦得听萧骚之句尤为警拔雨中看竹因用其语作两绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"离立何妨出屋高，风微亦得听萧骚。\n南山昨夜新雷起，行有横鞭破土膏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47182,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"尹丈少稷旧作借竹轩诗数首如雨重时惊入屋梢风微亦得听萧骚之句尤为警拔雨中看竹因用其语作两绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"山居面面皆脩竹，雨重时惊入屋梢。\n坐诵方斋旧诗句，人间那有续弦胶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47183,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"廿二日题水南寺壁","author":"赵蕃","text":"落花飞蝶两翾翾，二月清明雨后天。\n白酒一杯成坐睡，宿寒犹在未除绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47184,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文殊院晨起","author":"赵蕃","text":"山禽百族自呼名，撩我僧窗睡不成。\n纵汝多言吾自喜，了知今日十分晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47185,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方池","author":"赵蕃","text":"藻荇参遮面，菰蒲耸立隅。\n飞来双野鸭，几幅画成图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47186,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日者张一麟求诗谩与二绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"惶恐离头住过秋，秋风吹白几分头。\n倚楼看镜嫌多事，况问阴阳家者流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47187,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日者张一麟求诗谩与二绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"袖里之书辱见捐，细看知是我行年。\n家徒四壁将何赠，乞与两诗赊卦钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47188,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"万顷苍波月一钩，鹭鸥栖稳雁悠悠。\n老夫于此兴不浅，无奈凛乎何可留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47189,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"水鸟飞鸣自往还，苍然暝色暗林峦。\n离家又见磨镰月，九月谁怜絺绤寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47190,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月岩 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"论画以形诗必此，东坡老子笑人痴。\n月岩本是梯空石，底事轻论圆与亏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47191,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月岩 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"举头见日犹为近，何况凌虚到月边。\n更欲裴徊究真妄，无人与我共谈玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47192,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木芙蓉","author":"赵蕃","text":"三两芙蓉并水丛，向人能白亦能红。\n浩然不在芍药下，如何独占晚秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47193,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀四首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"我生天与山林相，不羡人间富贵花。\n折